00:17:17,165 --> 00:17:27,204
It doesn't just blindly execute, it actively monitors the validation metrics, identifies where the model is failing, and autonomously shifts the computing and data generation resources to fix it.

236
00:17:27,694 --> 00:17:35,184
It accumulates evidence through the subagents and the coordinator runtime and revises its experimental plans over a long temporal horizon.

237
00:17:35,470 --> 00:17:40,804
Based on the documented results, the paper establishes Cowork OS as a highly effective harness.

238
00:17:41,518 --> 00:17:52,064
By successfully separating execution strategy from state management through the main agent, subagent, and coordinator runtime layers, it mitigates context bloat and enables sustained automation.

